        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "Within the Temple of Space, you will see the Keepers who are transporting these Elemental Cubes. They can only move along fixed trajectories.\nWhen in an active state, these Keepers can swallow the Elemental Cubes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "Page 2/3",
        "img": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/04/08/b4a647a4dc93eb6d6d59e473134fea93_8088266008612458709.png",
        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "Transport-type Keepers have both high-altitude and low-altitude modes. With Dex's help, you can toggle between the two modes to easily retrieve Elemental Cubes from various terrains.\nWhen in their low-altitude mode, the Transport-type Keeper's movement speed increases."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "Page 3/3",
        "img": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/04/08/649a4a70e6818e2bfa10995773b40ccd_7169306459981697266.png",
        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "When Hydro Cubes, Pyro Cubes, and Dendro Cubes are next to each other, they will react in pairs and then dissolve.\nYou can use Geo Cubes or Space Cubes to separate these cubes to ensure smooth transportation."
          }
        ]
      }
